// G3 up to G4 and back in three positions of G major:
// pos. 1 frets 2-5 (root under finger 2), pos. 2 frets 7-10 (root on string 5 under finger 4),
// pos. 3 frets 9-12 (root on string 5 under finger 2).
\title "G major in three positions"
\tempo 100
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
